framework from TauricResearch. The journal application replaces the previous
application code; the original code and license remain available in Git history.
The Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

This project is not an official TauricResearch product and does not imply
endorsement by the original authors. Third-party npm/Android dependencies retain
their respective licenses. The development-only Android signing key is documented
in android-signing/README.md and must not be used for production distribution.
